<#f0f000>Movelist :</>

<#f0f000>Basics:</>

Run					_F_F
Back Hop				_B_B
Super Jump				_D_U

Light Punch				^X
Heavy Punch				^Y
Light Kick				^A
Heavy Kick				^B

Low Light Punch				^A (crouch)
Low Heavy Punch				^Y (crouch)
Low Light Kick				^A (crouch)
Low Sweep				^B (crouch)
(Knocks Down)

Aerial Light Punch				^A (air)
Aerial Heavy Punch				^Y (air)
Aerial Light Kick				^A (air)
Aerial Heavy Kick				^B (air)

Grab					[_B/_F]_+^Y (When Close)

<#f0f000>Unique Attacks:</>

Freezing Bear				^A+^B
(Followup with ^A+^B again if it succesfully connects,
Usable once per combo)

<#f0f000>Special Attacks:</>

Flaming Tiger				_D_DF_F^X / _D_DF_F^Y
(^Y fires twice and knocks down)

Biting Shark				_D_DB_B^X / _D_DB_B^Y
(^X can be cancelled into other specials on hit, ^Y lunges
forwards and knocks down)

Rising Upper				_D_D^X / _D_D^Y
(Gains aerial control if it hits, allowing for combos)

Case Counter				_D_DF_F^A / _D_DF_F^B
(Works on Standing or Crouching Physical Attacks)

Flying Falcon				_D_DB_B^A / _D_DB_B^B
(Usable in the Air)

<#f0f000>Lvl.1 Super Attacks:</>

Case Strash				_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^X
Rising Impact				_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A

<#f0f000>Lvl.2 Super Attacks:</>

Assault Hopper: Buster Bomber				_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^X
Metal Cluster Hopper				_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A
(Counter Move)

<#f0f000>Lvl.3 Super Attacks:</>

When a prior round is won and the enemy is under 300 HP:
Realizing Impact			_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^X+^Y
(Usable once per match)